This licence covers the code in this repository only. Data and media have their own terms:
- Event data derives from Wikidata (CC0) and Wikipedia lead paragraphs (CC BY-SA 4.0); see site/data/events.json and the credits shown in the app.
- Photographs in site/img are from Wikimedia Commons under the licence recorded per file in site/data/images.json (public domain or Creative Commons), credited in each event panel.
- The Earth texture is NASA's Blue Marble (public domain).
- Country outlines are Natural Earth (public domain) via the world-atlas package (ISC).
- three.js (site/vendor) is MIT; astronomy-engine (site/vendor) is MIT.
- Star, constellation and Milky Way data (site/assets/sky.json) derive from d3-celestial (BSD-3-Clause, Olaf Frohn), which draws on the Yale Bright Star Catalog and the HYG database.
